<v Mike>How could it be lost?

00:03:31.300 --> 00:03:33.400
<v Sean>You are asking the real questions.

00:03:33.660 --> 00:03:39.920
<v Mike>Right. But this is a rare game, not in the sense of it doing anything interesting, just that it's

00:03:39.920 --> 00:03:42.220
<v Mike>developed by the company Rare.

