<v Mike>He's not a literal caveman like the ones you would see in caveman games that we played

00:04:15.800 --> 00:04:22.220
<v Mike>on the NES. This one just meant that he dwells in caves in this game, and so you will...

00:04:23.340 --> 00:04:28.640
<v Mike>You're helping him reach the lost city, question mark, if it's actually lost.

00:04:30.580 --> 00:04:39.080
<v Mike>In terms of the gameplay loop, you are in stages of the cavern, and your goal is to find the

00:04:39.080 --> 00:04:45.080
