<v Mike>But it has a lot more of the elements as well.

00:37:38.700 --> 00:37:39.680
<v Sean>Well, all right.

00:37:39.680 --> 00:37:44.000
<v Sean>All right. I retract everything that I ever said.

00:37:44.120 --> 00:37:45.120
<v Sean>And this game is essential.

00:37:45.420 --> 00:37:48.760
<v Mike>I can't get. No, I was trying to give you less points towards Digger T.

00:37:48.860 --> 00:37:52.080
<v Mike>You were helping it give a great franchise its birth.

00:37:52.140 --> 00:37:54.360
<v Mike>And I was like, hey, don't be so quick.

